      "content": "thanks, that helps a lot. so if i'm looking at the legitimacy of the claims, how do historians usually weigh the Zionist right to self-determination against the Palestinian right to national sovereignty on that land? is there a consensus on which claim holds more historical or legal weight, or is it totally subjective?",
